WEBVTT

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:59.970
Returning from Otherworld, Goku raced away from the lookout on the flying Nimbus to join-

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:10.740
his friends on the battlefield, Piccolo, Gohan, and Krillin put their training and

00:02:10.740 --> 00:02:16.080
skills to the test as they fought desperately against Nappa and Vegeta. Two

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:20.940
Saiyans bent on conquering the Earth, but their combined strength was no match

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:29.980
for the evil pair, while the others watched in vain for new

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:35.100
of the battle, the Saiyans continued their ruthless conquest as Nappa unleashed the full

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:55.010
force of his rage on Gohan. Kill you! Is this the end for Gohan? Find out next on Dragon Ball Z!

00:04:06.270 --> 00:04:10.360
It's okay, kid. No sweat.

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:24.820
Can't be hurt, Piccolo. You just can't.

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:26.100
We need you.

00:04:27.140 --> 00:04:28.720
I'm not gonna make it.

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:34.040
It's up to you. You must stop them.

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:41.970
Piccolo, hold on just a little longer. My dad's coming. He'll save us. Just hold on.

00:04:42.410 --> 00:04:49.330
Ah, too bad. I wanted to take my time with the Namek. Oh well. I can still have fun with the kid.

00:04:58.380 --> 00:04:59.180
Nothing's not right.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.640
The big power levels is fading fast.

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:03.520
They're in trouble.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:05.400
Hang on, Gohan!

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:05.940
I'm coming!

00:05:24.600 --> 00:05:24.960
Coming?

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:25.700
What is it?

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:27.880
Piccolo's life force is fading away,

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:29.180
and mine along with it.

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:29.960
Go...

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.500
Who must not have gotten there in time.

00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:35.330
When we cease to exist, so will the Dragon Balls of this world.

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:37.910
But, legend tells of others on Namek.

00:05:38.050 --> 00:05:39.970
Find them. Use them to wish us back.

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:43.470
It's coming, please.

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:51.950
It's ironic, isn't it?

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:54.940
After all my years of training to defeat your father,

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:58.490
I'd go out like this, trying to save you, his son.

00:06:03.610 --> 00:06:09.970
Oh, the real friend that I've ever had, I want to thank you.

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:12.600
Just hold on a little longer.

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:23.070
I swear on the first day I brought you here, you were small, helpless, changed so much since then.

00:06:26.730 --> 00:06:29.480
The harder things got, the more determined you became.

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:34.450
The more dangers you faced, the stronger you grew as a warrior.

00:06:34.940 --> 00:06:41.140
No, I was hard on you, but it was for your own good.

00:06:45.730 --> 00:06:55.160
You're like the son I never had, my friend.

00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:31.250
Huh?

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:33.620
Go?

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:42.210
Our level's over 2,000.

00:07:43.130 --> 00:07:43.670
Hold on.

00:07:47.120 --> 00:07:48.600
It's over 3,000.

00:07:48.840 --> 00:07:49.880
Napa, watch out!

00:07:50.060 --> 00:07:52.660
This one is much more powerful than he appears!

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:54.320
Here I come, boy!

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:14.280
Hey, not too bad, kid. That made my arm numb.

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:18.500
All right, then. It's my turn.

00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:23.470
Ah, that one shot must have drained all of his energy.

00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:26.010
His power level has returned to normal.

00:08:27.760 --> 00:08:29.980
They're too strong. Just...

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.000
I can't stop them!

00:08:34.560 --> 00:08:37.540
Can't let you go, Gigi, it's too dangerous!

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:39.620
I've gotta help them!

00:08:40.180 --> 00:08:41.100
I've gotta!

00:08:42.470 --> 00:08:43.890
Gohan needs me!

00:08:47.910 --> 00:08:48.770
Somebody stop!

00:08:49.820 --> 00:08:55.480
Nice to see you too!

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:57.460
It's Baba!

00:08:58.280 --> 00:08:59.960
I've come to tell you that Goku has-

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:06.840
returned and will soon join the others in battle you mean he's really back Goku

00:09:06.840 --> 00:09:12.520
thank goodness I know let's see how things are going out there by looking

00:09:12.520 --> 00:09:13.980
into Baba's crystal ball

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:35.860
Don't worry, Piccolo. I won't let you down.

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:38.260
Hehehehehehe

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:42.030
Gohan! Run away! Hurry!

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:45.460
Hehehe! That's right! Run away and hide!

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:46.820
Hehehehe

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:51.180
No way. Piccolo's counting on me.

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:53.240
Nooo!

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:07.750
Nice knowing you, kid! There'll always be a soft spot at the bottom of my b- for ya!

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:09.910
So long!

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:29.970
I come from...

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:38.660
uh members how did he what the huh

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:18.170
Nice of you to join us.

00:11:46.320 --> 00:11:48.100
I was beginning to think you weren't going to show up,

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:51.340
especially after your little family reunion with Raditz.

00:11:51.860 --> 00:11:53.440
Did you two have fun catching up?

00:12:02.590 --> 00:12:05.170
Goku, you're here!

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:08.310
My dad's back.

00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:14.510
I see. Not much for words, eh, Kakarot?

00:12:15.320 --> 00:12:16.480
Well, you're just in time.

00:12:16.680 --> 00:12:20.500
We were getting tired of beating on these so-called fighters over and over again.

00:12:20.680 --> 00:12:21.440
What a joke.

00:12:34.540 --> 00:12:34.900
Piccolo.

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:38.550
He was protecting me.

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:40.090
He saved me.

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:48.910
N.

00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:00.970
Yamcha.

00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:05.360
Oh, are these guys friends of yours?

00:13:05.520 --> 00:13:06.520
Sorry about that.

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:09.020
They were fun to fight for a while,

00:13:09.160 --> 00:13:11.240
but they all met the same fate in the end.

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:15.990
Yeah, that's right.

00:13:16.210 --> 00:13:17.790
I took care of them all.

00:13:28.090 --> 00:13:29.470
Except for that little guy,

00:13:29.590 --> 00:13:29.970
he decided...

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:46.530
to blow himself up and the whole time i was pounding them they were waiting for you to show up

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:51.870
somehow they knew you were coming but it didn't matter you were too late

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:03.950
Kakarot's power level is increasing.

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:12.860
They were weak, just like you are.

00:14:15.840 --> 00:14:17.640
Weak and not worth my time.

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:21.820
He's fast!

00:14:23.820 --> 00:14:26.360
Come on, Gohan.

00:14:27.850 --> 00:14:29.170
Hey Krillin, are you alright?

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:30.640
Fantastic.

00:14:31.420 --> 00:14:32.970
I was a little late.

00:14:33.260 --> 00:14:35.380
Sorry, but it's okay now.

00:14:37.920 --> 00:14:40.320
Oh, I almost forgot a special delivery from Korin.

00:14:40.380 --> 00:14:40.860
Here.

00:14:41.220 --> 00:14:43.020
Wow, a Senzu bean.

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:45.020
I sure am glad to see that.

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:47.440
This was his last one.

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:49.520
Whoa, wait a minute.

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.480
Maybe you should keep it then.

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:54.240
Nah, I've already had one for myself, Krillin.

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:55.380
This one's for you.

00:14:56.520 --> 00:14:58.960
I'm wasting it, dude.

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:03.380
If you're going to try and take down both of these guys.

00:15:04.430 --> 00:15:05.970
Your help that I might need.

00:15:06.660 --> 00:15:08.280
That's the truth, Krillin, I promise.

00:15:09.740 --> 00:15:10.840
Here, take half.

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:12.750
Thanks, Coco.

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:16.320
The other half's for you, Gohan.

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:22.330
We got to learn how to grow those beans.

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:26.480
Krillin, you've gotten a lot stronger.

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:27.510
I can feel it.

00:15:28.490 --> 00:15:29.970
Yeah, I was doing great until...

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:37.440
fighting started we've all improved thanks to kami of course but man i guess it just wasn't enough

00:15:37.440 --> 00:15:43.340
hey gohan you look stronger too i could tell that you've been training hard

00:15:44.450 --> 00:15:50.450
piccolo's been taking care of me he was great and he taught me so many things now he's gone

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:57.380
and it's it's up to us to bring him back i don't know how we can do it but we have to we just have

00:15:57.380 --> 00:15:57.920
to dad

00:16:00.670 --> 00:16:01.970
We will, son. We will.

00:16:02.360 --> 00:16:05.740
But first, we have to focus on taking these guys down, once and for all.

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:09.360
You're right, Goku.

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:12.120
Man, it's not over yet.

00:16:12.770 --> 00:16:16.340
Hey, with your increased strength and us back at full power,

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:19.700
we should have a pretty good chance of beating those jerks.

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:22.040
Right, but you've done your part.

00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:25.120
Maybe it's best if the two of you sit this one out.

00:16:25.360 --> 00:16:28.420
This time, I think I'm going to take them on all by myself.

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:29.980
Goku, you can't!

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:31.760
See that big guy over there?

00:16:31.980 --> 00:16:35.060
He beat every last one of us without even breaking a sweat!

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:37.600
The only chance we have is to stick together!

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:39.380
He's right, Dad!

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:42.030
That guy, he's really strong!

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:45.100
Goku?

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:01.360
No, Dad.

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:03.260
Wait, Gohan.

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:04.320
Just let him go.

00:17:04.940 --> 00:17:06.060
Come back, please.

00:17:08.800 --> 00:17:10.540
I've never seen him like this, Gohan.

00:17:10.660 --> 00:17:11.900
He's different somehow.

00:17:12.220 --> 00:17:15.270
I think we should just do what he says.

00:17:27.930 --> 00:17:29.110
He's gone on long enough.

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:36.520
It ends right here, right now!

00:17:38.790 --> 00:17:43.410
Deep into my crystal ball!

00:17:43.570 --> 00:17:46.700
Crystal ball, show them all what they want to see!

00:17:47.170 --> 00:17:50.790
Crystal ball, show them all their friends and family!

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:54.750
Something's happening! Is that?

00:17:54.890 --> 00:17:55.590
Could it be?

00:17:55.890 --> 00:17:56.590
It's Goku!

00:17:57.370 --> 00:17:57.990
Goku!

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:01.410
Look!

00:18:01.790 --> 00:18:02.690
Lennon Gohan!

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:05.620
BG!

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:11.000
Are you okay, dear?

00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:12.850
Oh, the day!

00:18:12.970 --> 00:18:13.190
Go!

00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:26.470
If Piccolo's gone, that means Kami's gone as well!

00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:29.370
And the Dragon Balls, they're gone too!

00:18:30.350 --> 00:18:33.810
That means... we... can't wish them back?

00:18:41.360 --> 00:18:52.440
I haven't got all day!

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:56.540
Heh, I wanna see what the great Kakarot's made of!

00:18:57.200 --> 00:18:59.960
Ha! You want me? You got-

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:00.300
ME!

00:19:01.310 --> 00:19:01.670
HEH!

00:19:28.150 --> 00:19:29.070
OVER NINE!

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:59.970
you say his level is over 9000 there's no way that could be right don't be so sure i'll have you

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.840
I didn't know I was trained in the art of K.O. Ken!

00:20:02.000 --> 00:20:02.940
Huh? K.O. Ken?

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:05.620
K.O. Whatever! Who cares?

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:07.920
I'm still gonna crush you!

00:20:08.080 --> 00:20:09.820
I don't care what you've learned!

00:20:10.360 --> 00:20:25.280
How did he do that?

00:20:30.760 --> 00:20:34.360
You'll pay for that, you'll...

00:20:37.240 --> 00:20:39.600
We'll see, but I haven't even warmed up yet.

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:42.830
What? Why, you little...

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:47.000
That was luck! I'm the second strongest Saiyan in the universe!

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:51.690
Well, if your friend is stronger than you, then I'd say that makes you the third strongest.

00:20:55.960 --> 00:20:59.360
Kakarot, I'm gonna rip you apart!

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:00.640
HAAAGH!

00:21:04.080 --> 00:21:19.720
Yeah, I mean, just a year ago he couldn't beat Rabbits, and now he's making sport a map-off.

00:21:25.830 --> 00:21:26.030
Ha!

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:28.060
Over here!

00:21:28.360 --> 00:21:28.640
Ha!

00:21:30.920 --> 00:21:37.930
You see how your father did that?

00:21:39.450 --> 00:21:40.910
Uh, uh-uh.

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:41.870
You?

00:21:43.380 --> 00:21:45.980
I'll get my hands on you and when I do!

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:53.350
Never heard of anyone increasing their power level that much in one year.

00:22:05.860 --> 00:22:23.060
For my friends, all four of them.

00:22:24.620 --> 00:22:28.720
Will Goku's increased level of power be enough to stop the Saiyans?

00:22:28.880 --> 00:22:29.980
Find out next time.

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:32.020
on Dragon Ball Z.
